            <p>That one travelled past the function entirely. When Theia launched publicly, the recognition came from the top of the house: <strong>the President of Sanofi France called it &laquo;&nbsp;this magnificent project&nbsp;&raquo;</strong> under the announcement, alongside the engineers and partners who had carried it since the hackathon.</p>
